    {
      "id": "fd1a5ce2-323e-4f64-8f0a-9f4ea126d86d",
      "name": "Sticky Note7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        16,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 824,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## File Monitoring, Metadata & Validation\n\nThis section monitors a Google Drive folder and prepares each file for ingestion.\n\n**Drive File Watcher** \u2013 Polls the selected folder for file updates and starts the ingestion pipeline.\n\n**Extract File Metadata** \u2013 Builds structured fields: fileId, fileName, mimeType, modifiedTime, documentVersion, source, and folderId.\n\n**Validate File** \u2013 Checks required fields and allows only supported document types (PDF, DOCX, DOC, TXT, MD, CSV). Unsupported files stop here and are not downloaded or embedded."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c5799594-bbca-40e4-87e6-0860cfd347c0",
      "name": "Download File from Drive1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
