    },
    {
      "id": "0de603c1-f87b-471b-8713-9a9bbe2c16b9",
      "name": "Sticky Note12",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        16,
        1616
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1004,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## Retrieval-Augmented Answering (RAG Engine)\n\nThis section performs semantic search and grounded answering.\n\n**Vector Search QA Tool** \u2013 Tool used by the AI Agent to look up knowledge-base facts.\n\n**Retrieve Vectors from Pinecone** \u2013 Searches index `n8n-new` / namespace `n8n-rag` for relevant chunks.\n\n**Generate Embeddings (Query)** \u2013 Embeds the user question for vector similarity search.\n\n**Secondary LLM (Retriever QA)** \u2013 Helps the vector tool produce answers strictly from retrieved context.\n\n**Conversation Memory Buffer** \u2013 Keeps multi-turn chat context using the request `sessionId`. Memory is only for understanding follow-ups, not for factual knowledge."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7204aef0-4418-48c5-aef0-c0872c027a67",
      "name": "Generate Embeddings (Query)1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "position": [
        576,
        2320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "yOfw9W9XwQefVROR",
          "name": "OpenAI (PAID) (AI-ML Team)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "cc0f04d7-b703-4e22-bdf0-d7dfe78e9132",
      "name": "Secondary LLM (Retriever QA)1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
